Content:
@BreakingTaps do you think we could get some appropriate photodiode DUTs covered on Run3 with a "sensor/specialties" shared test die?
I'd think to include it with @Andrew Wingate 's Hall Effect DUT.
And I should try if the **symmetric gated SCR/TRIAC** "Magic-only PCell"  (which we got in the SG13G2 PDK) can be DRC-legally be ported to gf180mcuD, which _I think_ is the case, and get that in as well because it's not suitable to co-exist with the normal chip ESD structures if it's to be tested.
